# Immutable Double-Entry Standard

- Zero Mutation Policy: Strictly prohibit `UPDATE` and `DELETE` queries on `ledger_transactions`.
- Reversal Vouchers: Corrections and cancellations must be posted as offsetting Debit Notes, Credit Notes, or Reversal Vouchers.
- Double-Entry Equation: Every financial transaction must satisfy `Sum(Debits) == Sum(Credits)`.
- System Reserve Accounts: Post walk-in cash sales to `SYSTEM_CASH`, invoice discount adjustments to `KASR_DISCOUNT_EXPENSE`, and total invoice volume to `SALES_REVENUE`.
